OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast
OL,6,Fwith periods of occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain through the evening, which turns
OL,8,Fpatchy and occasionally wintry to low
OL,9,Flevels overnight, as fresh to strong
OL,10,Fnortherly winds develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloud, rain, sleet and hill
OL,13,Fsnow initially, erratically clearing
OL,14,Fas sunshine and wintry showers follow
OL,15,Ffrom northwest through the day, with
OL,16,Foutbreaks focused over western areas.
OL,17,FMuch colder than Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
